WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.6 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Pay, careers and recognition

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Pay shows your values: set clear principles and bands, and apply them to everyone.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Write how pay is set, reviewed and increased.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Use bands with ranges, not one-off negotiations.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Recognise people in ways they actually value.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Same piece rate for the same piece, whoever weaves it; rates set each April and approved by members; staff salaries open to all.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your pay principles, bands and recognition.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
